# Long play: does the frame rate hold as trails fill up? The player turns now and then; the bot
# chases. Shots every 30 s show the debug readout (polygons, cpu, fps, late frames).
wait 17
press right
wait 30
shot long_1
press right
wait 30
shot long_2
press left
wait 30
shot long_3
press right
wait 30
shot long_4
press left
wait 30
shot long_5
press right
wait 30
shot long_6
